UID:8wk-3-20260816T100000@eightweekkitchen
DTSTAMP:20260815T120000Z
DTSTART:20260816T100000
DTEND:20260816T115000
SUMMARY:Meal prep · Settle
DESCRIPTION:Garlic-infused oil — make this first\, everything else uses it
 \n2½ lb chicken thighs — half Greek (lemon\, oregano\, garlic oil)\, half
  cumin-lime\nVegetable tray: 2 zucchini\, 3 red peppers\, 4 carrots\n2 cu
 ps rice\nTurkey chili\, no beans — 5 servings\, freeze 2\n8 hard-boiled e
 ggs\nLemon-yogurt sauce + ginger-scallion soy sauce\nFresh tomato-scallio
 n salsa\n3 jars overnight oats
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Meal prep · Settle
TRIGGER:-PT15M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8wk-4-20260817T171500@eightweekkitchen
DTSTAMP:20260815T120000Z
DTSTART:20260817T171500
DTEND:20260817T175500
SUMMARY:Week 1 · Strength A
DESCRIPTION:2 sets × 10 · rest 90s\n\n• Goblet squat — One dumbbell at you
 r chest. Sit down between your knees\, chest tall\, heels down.\n• Dumbbe
 ll floor press — On your back\, knees bent. Elbows stop when they touch t
 he floor — that is the depth.\n• Romanian deadlift — Push your hips BACK\
 , not down. Stop when you feel the hamstrings\, not when you reach the fl
 oor.\n• Shoulder press — Ribs down. Do not arch your lower back to get th
 e weight up.\n• Plank — Squeeze your glutes\, hips level with shoulders. 
 The set ends when the hips sag\, not when the clock says.\n\n2 sets of 10
 . Use 10–15 lb\, or nothing at all if a movement feels awkward. Finish ev
 ery set feeling like you had 4 more in you.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Week 1 · Strength A
TRIGGER:-PT20M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8wk-5-20260818T073000@eightweekkitchen
DTSTAMP:20260815T120000Z
DTSTART:20260818T073000
DTEND:20260818T081500
SUMMARY:Week 1 · Walk 20 min
DESCRIPTION:3.0 mph\, 0% incline. You should be able to talk in full sente
 nces.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Week 1 · Walk 20 min
TRIGGER:-PT20M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:8wk-6-20260820T171500@eightweekkitchen
DTSTAMP:20260815T120000Z
DTSTART:20260820T171500
DTEND:20260820T175500
SUMMARY:Week 1 · Strength B
DESCRIPTION:2 sets × 10 · rest 90s\n\n• Bent-over row — Hinge to about 45°
 \, back flat. Pull to your hips\, not your chest. Pause a beat at the top
 .\n• Split squat — One foot forward\, one back\, long stance. Straight do
 wn. All reps one side\, then the other.\n• Glute bridge — Dumbbell across
  the hips. Drive through your heels\, squeeze hard for a full second at t
 he top.\n• Curl + overhead extension — Curl up\, press overhead\, lower b
 ehind your head. One continuous movement.\n• Dead bug — On your back\, ar
 ms up\, knees at 90°. Lower opposite arm and leg slowly. Lower back stays
  glued down.\n\n2 sets of 10. Use 10–15 lb\, or nothing at all if a movem
 ent feels awkward. Finish every set feeling like you had 4 more in you.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Week 1 · Strength B
TRIGGER:-PT20M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
