SUMMARY:Week 2 · Strength A
DESCRIPTION:2 sets × 12 · rest 90s\n\n• Goblet squat — One dumbbell at you
 r chest. Sit down between your knees\, chest tall\, heels down.\n• Dumbbe
 ll floor press — On your back\, knees bent. Elbows stop when they touch t
 he floor — that is the depth.\n• Romanian deadlift — Push your hips BACK\
 , not down. Stop when you feel the hamstrings\, not when you reach the fl
 oor.\n• Shoulder press — Ribs down. Do not arch your lower back to get th
 e weight up.\n• Plank — Squeeze your glutes\, hips level with shoulders. 
 The set ends when the hips sag\, not when the clock says.\n\n2 sets of 12
 \, same dumbbells. Adding reps before weight is what protects your joints
  in the first month.
