UID:8wk-39-20260914T171500@eightweekkitchen
DTSTAMP:20260815T120000Z
DTSTART:20260914T171500
DTEND:20260914T175500
SUMMARY:Week 5 · Strength A
DESCRIPTION:3 × 12\, 3-second lowering\n\n• Goblet squat — One dumbbell at
  your chest. Sit down between your knees\, chest tall\, heels down.\n• Du
 mbbell floor press — On your back\, knees bent. Elbows stop when they tou
 ch the floor — that is the depth.\n• Romanian deadlift — Push your hips B
 ACK\, not down. Stop when you feel the hamstrings\, not when you reach th
 e floor.\n• Shoulder press — Ribs down. Do not arch your lower back to ge
 t the weight up.\n• Plank — Squeeze your glutes\, hips level with shoulde
 rs. The set ends when the hips sag\, not when the clock says.\n\n3 sets o
 f 12\, and count three seconds on the way DOWN of every rep. With 20 lb d
 umbbells\, tempo is how you keep progressing.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Week 5 · Strength A
TRIGGER:-PT20M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
