SUMMARY:Week 5 · Strength B
DESCRIPTION:3 × 12\, 3-second lowering\n\n• Bent-over row — Hinge to about
  45°\, back flat. Pull to your hips\, not your chest. Pause a beat at the
  top.\n• Split squat — One foot forward\, one back\, long stance. Straigh
 t down. All reps one side\, then the other.\n• Glute bridge — Dumbbell ac
 ross the hips. Drive through your heels\, squeeze hard for a full second 
 at the top.\n• Curl + overhead extension — Curl up\, press overhead\, low
 er behind your head. One continuous movement.\n• Dead bug — On your back\
 , arms up\, knees at 90°. Lower opposite arm and leg slowly. Lower back s
 tays glued down.\n\n3 sets of 12\, and count three seconds on the way DOW
 N of every rep. With 20 lb dumbbells\, tempo is how you keep progressing.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Week 5 · Strength B
TRIGGER:-PT20M
END:VALARM
