SUMMARY:Week 6 · Strength A
DESCRIPTION:3 × 12 tempo\, last set near-failure\n\n• Goblet squat — One d
 umbbell at your chest. Sit down between your knees\, chest tall\, heels d
 own.\n• Dumbbell floor press — On your back\, knees bent. Elbows stop whe
 n they touch the floor — that is the depth.\n• Romanian deadlift — Push y
 our hips BACK\, not down. Stop when you feel the hamstrings\, not when yo
 u reach the floor.\n• Shoulder press — Ribs down. Do not arch your lower 
 back to get the weight up.\n• Plank — Squeeze your glutes\, hips level wi
 th shoulders. The set ends when the hips sag\, not when the clock says.\n
 \n3 sets of 12 with the 3-second lowering. Last set of each: go to two re
 ps before failure\, whatever that number is.
